{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22889","headline":"香炉峰下新卜山居草堂初成偶题东壁 · 白居易","name":"香炉峰下新卜山居草堂初成偶题东壁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"五架三间新草堂，石阶桂柱竹编墙。\n南檐纳日冬天暖，北户迎风夏月凉。\n洒砌飞泉才有点，拂窗斜竹不成行。\n来春更葺东厢屋，纸阁芦帘着孟光。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22889.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22889","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}